• Multi-agent coordination functional
• Action execution reliable
• Context propagation active
• Adaptive learning operational
end note

note right of M5
**Thesis Completion Standards:**
• All chapters written & reviewed
• Experimental validation complete
• Statistical analysis performed
• Figures and tables prepared
• Bibliography formatted
• Appendices organized
end note

