**MVP Success Metrics:**
• 20+ diverse websites successfully automated
• Pattern recognition accuracy >85%
• Self-healing triggers in <30 seconds
• Action execution success >80%
• Semantic classification accuracy >90%
• System uptime >95% during testing
end note

note bottom of SUCCESS_CRITERIA
**Graduation Requirements:**
• Магистерская диссертация защищена
• Рабочая система продемонстрирована
• Научная новизна обоснована
• Практическая значимость показана
• Результаты статистически значимы
• Код и данные опубликованы
end note

note right of ENTERPRISE
**Post-Graduation Opportunities:**
• Startup founding potential
• Industry collaboration
• PhD program application
• Patent applications
• Research publications
• Commercial licensing
end note

@enduml